  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So, I noticed a very odd issue that I don't understand about the prone animation, from my pov, I look all messed up and my arms are out in front of me, rigid... but to everyone else it looks normal. Another thing is, the viewpoint seems to be in the chest area instead of the head, which makes it to where I look up, it's inside my model. I've also tried a bunch of different models, my private ones and ones from avatar worlds, and asked a few of my other friends who use Desktop and they all have these issues too.",
